# Project Vision & Mission

## Vision
To develop a simple, efficient, and reliable digital ledger system that helps small and medium enterprises (UMKM) manage their financial transactions, inventory, and business performance in real time.

## Mission
- Provide an easy-to-use system for recording income and expense transactions accurately.
- Enable real-time inventory tracking to prevent stock shortages and overstocking.
- Support business decision-making through financial visualization such as revenue tracking and BEP (Break-Even Point) monitoring.
- Ensure data persistence and continuity using browser local storage.
- Simplify financial reporting through automated Excel export functionality.
- Improve operational efficiency for UMKM through a lightweight web-based application.
